# This folder holds the committed Windows SOURCE (Resource.rc / resource.h /
# Avp_32x32_8bit.ico) plus CMake-generated per-arch build trees (x64/, x86/, ...).
# The old .gitignore only ignored a few build subdirs, so a stray configure into
# THIS folder committed avp.sln/*.vcxproj/cmake_install.cmake/Resource.aps and left
# three overlapping solutions. Fix: ignore everything, then re-include only the
# source. Generated solution/project files can never be committed again.
*
!.gitignore
!Resource.rc
!resource.h
!Avp_32x32_8bit.ico
!x86/
!x64/
!arm64/